  "headline": "Ghanaian President Mahama expresses openness to Russian security assistance in Sahel",
  "pages": [
    {
      "text": "Speaking at the Financial Times Africa Summit in London on Wednesday, October 21, 2026, Ghanaian President John Dramani Mahama stated he is not concerned about Russian security assistance in the Sahel region. Mahama said that anyone committed to the fight against terrorism is welcome in the region. Regarding the deployment of a West African standby force to address insecurity, the President attributed delays to the absence of a United Nations resolution required to provide necessary financing."
    }
  ]
}

